        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 4:55AM AKDT until September 26 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Coastal Waters Forecast for the Northern Gulf of Alaska Coast
up to 100 nm out including Kodiak Island and Cook Inlet.

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...SE wind 30 kt. Seas 10 ft.
.TONIGHT...SE wind 30 kt. Seas 12 ft. Rain.
.SAT...SE wind 25 kt. Seas 11 ft. Rain showers.
.SAT NIGHT...S wind 25 kt. Seas 11 ft.
.SUN...S wind 15 kt. Seas 10 ft.
.MON THROUGH TUE...Variable wind 10 kt. Seas 8 ft.
</description>
